-- GAME ----------------------------------------------------------------------
  Title       The Great Escape
  Publisher   Ocean, 1986
  Version     1.0

-- YOU NEED ------------------------------------------------------------------
  Your own copy of the original game, saved beside this patch:

  File        Great Escape, The (1986)(Ocean).z80
  MD5         ff5eae3b61188cb5095a6177c3c34a06

  The patch carries none of the game's code. It only works with that exact
  dump, under that name or any other: anything else is refused, with a
  message naming the file it wants.

-- WHAT IT DOES --------------------------------------------------------------
  The game's play area has no colour clash, so none is removed: the default
  keeps the original look. The patch adds the menu, its cheats and the Next
  start-up. The menu's Presentation line adds more; see the note. Game logic
  is unchanged. Enhanced colours, an option on the menu, are below.

  Colours     Default (the game's own) plus: Enhanced, chosen on the menu, off
              by default.
  Enhanced    The camp and every figure painted in period colours on Layer 2:
              prisoners in varied RAF blue, brown, cream and olive, guards in
              muted uniforms, timber, slate and dusty ground. The game's own
              black linework, masks and drawing order stay, so depth and the
              searchlight work as before. A painted set, colourist not named.

  Note        Menu: Enhanced turns the colours on; McQueen player (needs
              Enhanced, turns it on with it) dresses the player in McQueen's
              outfit, while a guard disguise still looks like a guard. Known
              issues: Enhanced runs within 2% of the original's pace in JNext;
              the searchlight and movement step as coarsely as in the
              original. Missing: a natural playthrough to the end and a real
              Next run.

-- MENU ----------------------------------------------------------------------
   1  Infinite morale
   2  No other people
   3  Pass through doors

  Cheats come from the archive's POKEs for this release.

