-- TESTING -------------------------------------------------------------------
  Tested      NexClash differential verification against four recordings (two
              play, an abort/restart and a result-screen run); simulated boot
              of every build; run from its menu in OverSpec in default,
              Enhanced and McQueen. Played by the owner in OverSpec,
              2026-11-27: Enhanced and McQueen play. Not on real hardware.

  Replay      Four recordings identical on this build (two play, an
              abort/restart and a result-screen run): 53158 frames, 457675
              hooks.

  Emulator    OverSpec: the owner played Enhanced and McQueen from this menu
              (2026-11-27). JNext 1.1.104 ran every menu choice of the pilot
              build through the real .NEXCLASH loader on NextZXOS 26.11
              (2026-11-09).

  Coverage    Two play recordings, an abort/restart run and a controlled
              result-screen run (not a natural finish). Default keeps the
              original monochrome picture; Enhanced adds period colours. Fits
              a 1MB Next.

  Hardware    Not tested

  Nothing here claims a result on real hardware unless the line above says so.

-- HOW TO USE ----------------------------------------------------------------
  Put this .nxc and the game file in the same folder on the Next's card and
  choose the .nxc in the Browser. See README.txt.
